<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 11:12:43 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>一个圆形披萨，配有番茄酱、马苏里拉奶酪和萨拉米香肠，放在烤炉内的披萨石上。</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa68526eb97d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一个圆形披萨，配有番茄酱、马苏里拉奶酪和萨拉米香肠，放在烤炉内的披萨石上。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A round pizza with tomato sauce, mozzarella cheese, and salami sits on a pizza stone inside a grill. - Eine runde Pizza mit Tomatensauce, Mozzarella und Salami liegt auf einem Pizzastein in einem Grill." height="5712" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6aa68526eb97d.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 11:12:43 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>一台唱片机正在播放一张大理石纹黑胶唱片，其后方展示着一张名为“Lakmann versus Morlockko Plus Argus”的唱片专辑封面。</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa684e95fe98</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一台唱片机正在播放一张大理石纹黑胶唱片，其后方展示着一张名为“Lakmann versus Morlockko Plus Argus”的唱片专辑封面。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='A record player with a marbled vinyl record playing, with a record album cover titled "Lakmann versus Morlockko Plus Argus" displayed behind it. - Ein Plattenspieler mit einer marmorierten Schallplatte, im Hintergrund das Plattencover mit dem Titel "Lakmann versus Morlockko Plus Argus".' height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6aa684e95fe98.jpg" width="4284"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 11:11:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>放在粉色盘子上的美食汉堡的俯视特写，配有一份凉拌卷心菜、一勺蛋黄酱和一杯啤酒。</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa684af9fb7d</link><description>&lt;p&gt;放在粉色盘子上的美食汉堡的俯视特写，配有一份凉拌卷心菜、一勺蛋黄酱和一杯啤酒。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A close-up overhead view of a gourmet burger on a pink plate, with a side of coleslaw, a dollop of mayonnaise, and a glass of beer. - Eine Nahaufnahme von oben auf einen Gourmet-Burger auf einem rosa Teller, mit einem Beilagensalat, einem Klecks Mayonnaise und einem Glas Bier." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6aa684af9fb7d.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 11:10:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>两杯金色啤酒浮着厚厚的白色泡沫，放在一张木桌上。</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa68474ce0fd</link><description>&lt;p&gt;两杯金色啤酒浮着厚厚的白色泡沫，放在一张木桌上。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Two mugs of golden beer with thick white foam sit on a wooden table. - Zwei Krüge goldenen Bieres mit dickem weißem Schaum stehen auf einem Holztisch." height="4284" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6aa68474ce0fd.jpg" width="5712"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 13 Sep 2026 11:09:44 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>戴风暴兵面具的狗</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa5e14e1f43a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一只戴着风暴兵面具的狗。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A dog wearing a stormtrooper mask. " height="3484" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/amd/6aa5e14e1f43a.jpg" width="2613"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://amd.some.pics"&gt;@amd&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 23:33:37 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6aa5d1a6e3458</link><description>&lt;p&gt;紫薇&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A tree with pink flowers under a clear blue sky." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/macmanx/6aa5d1a6e3458.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://macmanx.some.pics"&gt;@macmanx&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 22:26:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>太阳替代品</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa57f66e6e21</link><description>&lt;p&gt;太阳替代品&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt=" A small yellow mushroom, probably Hygrocybe ceracea,  standing amidst green, wet grass, its yellow colour stands out particularly vividly. " height="1862" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6aa57f66e6e21.jpg" width="2328"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 16:35:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>一个搜索栏，其中包含文本“tinystart”，以及“TinyStart”应用程序和“Configure TinyStart”设置的搜索结果。</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa5647c78ae2</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一个搜索栏，其中包含文本“tinystart”，以及“TinyStart”应用程序和“Configure TinyStart”设置的搜索结果。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt='A search bar with the text "tinystart" and search results for "TinyStart" application and "Configure TinyStart" settings. - Suchleiste mit dem Text „tinystart“ und Suchergebnissen für die Anwendung „TinyStart“ und die Einstellungen „Configure TinyStart“.' height="804" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/b30/6aa5647c78ae2.png" width="972"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://b30.some.pics"&gt;@b30&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 14:41:03 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>准备好了！</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa54f996c2eb</link><description>&lt;p&gt;准备好了！&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Ready!" height="4012" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/atog/6aa54f996c2eb.jpg" width="3004"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://atog.some.pics"&gt;@atog&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 13:11:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>我有贴纸啦啦啦啦啦 😍。感谢 @robb 的贴纸（还有那些可爱的小赠品！❤️）。现在正琢磨着把它们都贴到我的 ThinkPad 上哪儿。</title><link>https://some.pics/6aa5342bdfd3f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;我有贴纸啦啦啦啦啦 😍。感谢 @robb 的贴纸（还有那些可爱的小赠品！❤️）。现在正琢磨着把它们都贴到我的 ThinkPad 上哪儿。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Many sets of stickers laid out on a desk including terminal, emacs, python and NixOS logos, as well as Robb’s training data, pirate ship and fountain pen stickers, plus assorted cute pigeons, crows, bats, octopuses and sea slugs. " height="4273" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/bsag/6aa5342bdfd3f.jpg" width="5697"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://bsag.some.pics"&gt;@bsag&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 11:14:56 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>